messages "Atreyu**Subj: pkillingCc: celtronDate: May  8Hello wizard Celtron and Onarion,I think you find this very interesting. I have my log when I do exp whenidle. I was standing in top of cleric guild. Dooyee comes and pkills me.I am not angry with him but 'help pkilling' says you are not allowed to'pkill'. Also in the log is that Torspo asks if I want ressurection butI am idle so I do not say 'yes' but he ressurects me?Here is log:(he probably was angry i do not ressurect him but I have all channels off)Ile leaves down.Paladin shouts: 'Rag bites the dust!'Adding exp for age.Demon shouts: 'Ile bites the dust!'Adding exp for age.Bernard shouts: 'Snuff bites the dust!'Demon shouts: 'Maddoc bites the dust!'Adding exp for age.Paladin shouts: 'Rag bites the dust!'Salesman shouts: 'Graendal bites the dust!'Adding exp for age.Adding exp for age.Adding exp for age.Adding exp for age.Adding exp for age.Adding exp for age.Paladin shouts: 'Dooyee bites the dust!'Adding exp for age.Dooyee arrives in a puff of smoke.Dooyee reports 'Hp: 176(329) Sp: 2305(2555) Ep: 138(139)'Dooyee leaves down.Dooyee arrives in a puff of smoke.Dooyee mumbles the magic word: 'exs'Dooyee suddenly disappears!Dooyee turns visible!Dooyee mumbles the magic word: 'exs'Dooyee casts teleport lock on you.Dooyee mumbles the magic word: 'exs'Your sensitive mind notices a wrongness in the fabric of space.Game driver tells you: You have no heart beat !Dooyee reports 'Hp: 176(329) Sp: 1065(2366) Ep: 137(139)'Dooyee mumbles the magic word: 'blt'Dooyee's Lightning Bolt hits YOU in the torso!You avoid part of the blast!..but the spell still hits you!That really HURT!The pain eases and allows you to move again.You die.You have a strange feeling.You can see your own dead body from above.Khaland tells you 'Type 'accept ress from khaland' if you wish to be resurrected. It will cost you 2680 bronze coins.'Your teleport lock wears off.Thelon arrives in a puff of smoke.Thelon disappears in a puff of smoke.Thelon disappears in a puff of smoke.Trooper shouts: Mita vittua te leikittaIle appears in a solid form.Demon shouts: 'Graendal bites the dust!'Graendal appears in a solid form.Demon shouts: 'Guest-1 bites the dust!'Wolf shouts: 'Snuff bites the dust!'Snuff appears in a solid form.Troll shouts: 'Snuff bites the dust!'Snuff appears in a solid form.Siki shouts: EXTREME FIREBALL!Irmeli shouts: imeTorspo tells you 'ressin?'Torspo resurrected you.You feel a very strong force.You are sucked away...You reappear in a more solid form.Ahma arrives from the south.(that was interesting part of log)Atreyu**"
